Third-party components used by open-airplay:

Receiver engine (built by engine/build-engine.sh; source is not vendored in this repository)
- UxPlay 1.74 (pinned commit in engine/UXPLAY_PIN), https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay (GPL-3.0)
  Includes playfair (GPL-3.0), llhttp (MIT) and a minimal mDNS responder (lib/mdnsd); see UxPlay's own notices.
  open-airplay applies the patches in engine/patches/.

